      <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-slate-500" data-finder-hint>
        Tip: exact measurements give the tightest match, and required clearance depends on the selected model, equipment
        layout and applicable local requirements. Or browse the full factory size and price matrix on the
        <a href="/products/specs/" class="text-primary dark:text-blue-400 underline underline-offset-2 font-medium">
          wholesale price list
